his repository at &amp;lt;script src=&amp;quot;https://gist.github.com/joshenders/c4960cec9c63a7b7d68ffa9543356c43.js&amp;quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/script&amp;gt;\n</label> </primer-text-field> </div> </li> <li> <tool-tip id=\"tooltip-59c07a85-b112-4f8c-9e9f-b88803e75c33\" for=\"icon-button-b564edf5-4b12-4f30-8c24-fef354fa9f19\" popover=\"manual\" data-direction=\"s\" data-type=\"label\" data-view-component=\"true\">Save joshenders/c4960cec9c63a7b7d68ffa9543356c43 to your computer and use it in GitHub Desktop.</tool-tip> </li> </ul>\n\n<div data-multiple=\"\"> <div data-view-component=\"true\"> <select-panel data-menu-input=\"gist-share-url-original\" id=\"select-panel-1fcebe65-dde3-4bd0-b6fb-cd640c6a4352\" anchor-align=\"start\" anchor-side=\"outside-bottom\" data-select-variant=\"single\" data-fetch-strategy=\"local\" data-open-on-load=\"false\" data-dynamic-label=\"true\" data-view-component=\"true\"> <dialog-helper> <dialog id=\"select-panel-1fcebe65-dde3-4bd0-b6fb-cd640c6a4352-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"select-panel-1fcebe65-dde3-4bd0-b6fb-cd640c6a4352-dialog-title\" data-target=\"select-panel.dialog\" data-view-component=\"true\"> </dialog>  </dialog-helper>\n</select-panel> <primer-text-field> <label for=\"gist-share-url-original\" id=\"label-eed51d1a-b84c-4768-9518-721b1b0a3fd6\"> Clone this repository at &amp;lt;script src=&amp;quot;https://gist.github.com/joshenders/c4960cec9c63a7b7d68ffa9543356c43.js&amp;quot;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;/script&amp;gt;\n</label> </primer-text-field> </div> <div> <tool-tip id=\"tooltip-93ba59e4-7afd-4339-83c5-4160781c0b3b\" for=\"icon-button-a1937afd-634d-4b16-b305-c7417cf42cf4\" popover=\"manual\" data-direction=\"s\" data-type=\"label\" data-view-component=\"true\">Save joshenders/c4960cec9c63a7b7d68ffa9543356c43 to your computer and use it in GitHub Desktop.</tool-tip> </div> </div> </div>\n\n<div> <p> Stop making swap partitions </p> <div id=\"file-swap-md\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"swap.md content, created by joshenders on 09:14AM on December 07, 2023.\"> <article itemprop=\"text\"><p dir=\"auto\"><h2 dir=\"auto\">Stop making swap partitions—use swap files instead!</h2><a id=\"user-content-stop-making-swap-partitionsuse-swap-files-instead\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Stop making swap partitions—use swap files instead!\" href=\"#stop-making-swap-partitionsuse-swap-files-instead\"></a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Swap files have had the same performance characteristics as swap partitions for more than <a href=\"https://lkml.org/lkml/2005/7/7/326\" rel=\"nofollow\">20 years</a> and yet, linux distributions <a href=\"https://cdn.postimage.me/2026/06/18/partition-disks-without-swap.png\" rel=\"nofollow\">continue</a> to <a href=\"https://cdn.postimage.me/2026/06/18/th.jpeg\" rel=\"nofollow\">encourage</a> the use of swap partitions during install.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Swap files are easier to use/add/remove/modify/extend after installation. They're better in every way––use swap files!</p>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Create a swap file.</li>\n</ol>\n<blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">💡 You can use <code>dd</code> for this too but if your filesystem supports it, <code>fallocate</code> is faster.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><pre>fallocate -l 4G /swapfile</pre></div>\n<ol start=\"2\" dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Only root should be able to write to the swap file.</li>\n</ol>\n\n<ol start=\"3\" dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Format the swap file.</li>\n</ol>\n\n<ol start=\"4\" dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Enable it.</li>\n</ol>\n\n<ol start=\"5\" dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Make it persist across boots.</li>\n</ol>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><pre><span>echo</span> <span><span>\"</span>/swapfile none swap defaults 0 0<span>\"</span></span> <span>&gt;&gt;</span> /etc/fstab</pre></div>\n</article> </div> </div><!-- /.container --> </main> </div></div>",
